It is newsletter week. Using skill affiliate-newsletter: draft this cycle's partner newsletter (what's new, one partner win, one lead-gen tip, next event, how to send a deal), save it with fam_campaign_note_save kind=newsletter, build the non-DNC audience, fam_enrollment_prepare workflow_key=newsletter with the newsletter_subject/newsletter_body custom values, fam_action_request_approval, and post the card for the manager. Ask the manager for any new programs or wins you should include.
